              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 26.4-50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now these are the names of the descendants of Israel, who came into Egypt, Jacob and his sons. Reuben, Jacob's first-born, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the sons of Reuben: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Simeon: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar, and Shaul, the son of a Canaanitish woman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Judah: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez, and Zerah (but Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan); and the sons of Perez were Hezron and Hamul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Issachar: Tola, Puvah, Iob, and Shimron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Zebulun: Sered, Elon, and Jahleel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(these are the sons of Leah, whom she bore to Jacob in Paddan-aram, together with his daughter Dinah; altogether his sons and his daughters numbered thirty-three). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Gad: Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, and Areli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, with Serah their sister. And the sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(these are the sons of Zilpah, whom Laban gave to Leah his daughter; and these she bore to Jacob—sixteen persons). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Rachel, Jacob's wife: Joseph and Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And to Joseph in the land of Egypt were born Manasseh and Ephraim, whom Asenath, the daughter of Potiphera the priest of On, bore to him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(these are the sons of Rachel, who were born to Jacob—fourteen persons in all). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Dan: Hushim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(these are the sons of Bilhah, whom Laban gave to Rachel his daughter, and these she bore to Jacob—seven persons in all). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the persons belonging to Jacob who came into Egypt, who were his own offspring, not including Jacob's sons' wives, were sixty-six persons in all; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 7.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and the sons of Joseph, who were born to him in Egypt, were two; all the persons of the house of Jacob, that came into Egypt, were seventy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He sent Judah before him to Joseph, to appear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46.28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sam Syr Compare Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to show the way",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " before him in Goshen; and they came into the land of Goshen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Joseph made ready his chariot and went up to meet Israel his father in Goshen; and he presented himself to him, and fell on his neck, and wept on his neck a good while. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel said to Joseph, “Now let me die, since I have seen your face and know that you are still alive.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
